- * 	Change 'osfmach3_mem_size' to be '__mem_size' for compatability with Linux/PPC
- * 	[1997/10/13  13:28:01  gdt]
- * 
- * Revision 1.1.2.14  1997/10/10  14:37:10  barbou
- * 	Reverted to the aggressive shrinking strategy (but kept the timer fix).
- * 	Don't allow "free_area" pages to be paged by the default_pager when
- * 	silent_overwrite is enabled (that could lead to paging space waste),
- * 	return the page to the micro-kernel instead.
- * 	[1997/10/10  14:30:10  barbou]
- * 
