- * 	[1996/11/18  17:43:00  barbou]
- * 
- * Revision 1.1.2.5  1996/10/29  18:27:25  barbou
- * 	Added osfmach3_update_vm_info.
- * 	[96/10/28            barbou]
- * 	[96/10/29            barbou]
- * 
- * Revision 1.1.4.1  1996/10/24  17:50:04  barbou
- * 	Print a message if vm_enough_pages() returns a negative
- * 	Attempts to improve the efficiency of the free_area_pager:
- * 	o increased the priority of the free_area_pager and free_area_shrinker
